Tej : What is the ms dhoni?
mahi : Mahendra Singh Dhoni, often hailed as “Mahi” or “Captain Cool,” is a legendary Indian cricketer renowned for his exceptional leadership, sharp wicket‑keeping skills, and formidable finishing prowess in limited‑overs formats.  
Born on July 7, 1981, in Ranchi, Jharkhand, Dhoni rose to prominence as a dynamic middle‑order batsman and a strategic captain, guiding India to historic triumphs—including the 2007 ICC World Twenty20, the 2010 and 2016 ICC World Cups, and the 2013 ICC Champions Trophy.  
His iconic helicopter shot, precise timing, and calm demeanor under pressure have earned him global acclaim, making him one of the most celebrated figures in modern cricket history.
